\ -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 7 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}].$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{0\\cdot 3-2\\cdot 7}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -7 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{14}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -7 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{14}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -7 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14014080/state.json" "file_sha256" "239c6f131425718e9730080a53ce04c8f469ce7edd38344c253c40dd8b36c41e"} {"question" "q-320803" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14014080/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "53ad7294ab68a8da72a45b73d2d11026b24d6e022411f009ec40c3c1f268afa6"} {"question" "q-320803" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14014080/state.json" "file_sha256" "239c6f131425718e9730080a53ce04c8f469ce7edd38344c253c40dd8b36c41e"} {"question" "q-320803" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{1}{14}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14014080/state.json" "file_sha256" "239c6f131425718e9730080a53ce04c8f469ce7edd38344c253c40dd8b36c41e"} {"question" "q-320803" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/math